  31:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \{
  32:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \defgroup IfxLld_Clock How to use the Clock driver?
