 923:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 1: OSC0 / fOSC0 is used as clock source
 924:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 2: SYSCLK / SYSCLK pin is used as clock source
